<p class="note">The facility list is illustrative. The UK site is outside the EU-27. <a href="$solvay">La Rochelle</a> · <a href="$silmet">Sillamäe</a> · <a href="$lcm">Ellesmere Port</a> · <a href="$narva">Narva commercial launch</a> · <a href="$expansion">Narva expansion</a>.</p>
<p>The direct-import gap in the scenario exceeds the nominal scale of the announced expansion. Estimating automotive deliveries requires buyer-grade demand, yields, inventories and alternative capacity by route. The 2025 import series provides a historical timing check. Plant delivery records are needed to validate the predicted shortfall or determine which stage bound first.</p>

