<aside class="panel" aria-labelledby="revision"><h2 id="revision">Revision note · 24 November 2026</h2>
<p>The earlier overview treated separation as a universal bottleneck and applied conclusions to unmeasured stages. This revision gives separation, metal and alloy production, and magnet-making separate roles. It also documents limits on what direct imports and plant nameplates can establish.</p></aside>
